  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nHi all,\n\nI am unsure if this is the right place to ask this question / point this out. I apologies if it isn't, just let me know and I will deleted this entry.\n\nI am investigating the parsing of DSD by LLMs, notably ChatGPT's bots which aren't as advanced / capable as Google's ones, for example.\n\nMy experiments show that DSD is not parsable by ChatBPT's bots (I have asked it to read content of pages using DSD and it is struggling to extract the content VS pages using plainer HTML).\n\nSearching across the web, I couldn't find a definite answer to this question. \n\nHas anyone done a similar research and came to the same conclusions? Or has anyone got a counter example that shows DSD is parsable by ChatGPT's bots?\n\nThank you.",
